{"items":[{"id":"1529982131920437248","title":"我以前不懂横幅上加英文是个什么意思 现…","content":"<p>我以前不懂横幅上加英文是个什么意思&lt;br&gt;现在全懂了。&lt;br&gt;外网全是这玩意……</p>","excerpt":"我以前不懂横幅上加英文是个什么意思 现…","voteupCount":223,"commentCount":48,"created":1657556165,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1529982131920437248"},{"id":"1529947210020491265","title":"好像有结果了","content":"<p>好像有结果了。&lt;br&gt;先给每个人5w</p>","excerpt":"好像有结果了","voteupCount":150,"commentCount":43,"created":1657547839,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1529947210020491265"},{"id":"1529613962886393857","title":"看有没有统战价值吧","content":"<p>看有没有统战价值吧</p><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/50/v2-f05d24edb4cb893cf87509ff6e3d461c_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1174\">","excerpt":"看有没有统战价值吧","voteupCount":216,"commentCount":31,"created":1657468387,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1529613962886393857"},{"id":"1529586715273986048","title":"[想法的图片]","content":"<img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/50/v2-43b82981525d62add78aef4e72dec629_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1908\">","excerpt":"[想法的图片]","voteupCount":281,"commentCount":43,"created":1657461891,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1529586715273986048"},{"id":"1529458240194265088","title":"就这媒体说的事吧","content":"<p>就这媒体说的事吧。&lt;br&gt;实际大家会发现一个问题，不管是曝光还是不曝光，最后问题解决了吗？&lt;br&gt;你会发现事情变得难看，舆论失控。&lt;br&gt;但现实没有发生任何改变。</p>","excerpt":"就这媒体说的事吧","voteupCount":176,"commentCount":27,"created":1657431260,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1529458240194265088"},{"id":"1528880845309509632","title":"算了，我改天有时间写一篇CA TB的文章吧…","content":"<p>算了，我改天有时间写一篇CA TB的文章吧。&lt;br&gt;现在知乎聊全球贸易的文章简直就不能看，多少买本教材回来研究一下也不是这个样子啊……&lt;br&gt;还是我又在第三层。&lt;br&gt;人家这样写就是要吃赢麻红利。</p>","excerpt":"算了，我改天有时间写一篇CA TB的文章吧…","voteupCount":107,"commentCount":8,"created":1657293598,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1528880845309509632"},{"id":"1528412491712884736","title":"QQ音乐飙升榜我从头翻到尾…… 1到100只…","content":"<p>QQ音乐飙升榜我从头翻到尾……&lt;br&gt;1到100只有5首不是周杰伦……</p><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-715adf3d1e1741cf8096fb7073e568a0_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"2460\">","excerpt":"QQ音乐飙升榜我从头翻到尾…… 1到100只…","voteupCount":130,"commentCount":17,"created":1657181934,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1528412491712884736"},{"id":"1528356122024644608","title":"[想法的图片]","content":"<img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/50/v2-a30fe1137ef6f14cb49cce6e864c1ca7_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"550\">","excerpt":"[想法的图片]","voteupCount":225,"commentCount":13,"created":1657168494,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1528356122024644608"},{"id":"1528179414847873024","title":"后台都问我为什么回答金融、经济以及其他…","content":"<p>后台都问我为什么回答金融、经济以及其他问题的时候不带点专业术语。&lt;br&gt;有没有这种可能。&lt;br&gt;就是我已经把这些专业术语已经尽可能淡化换成你们最好理解的词汇去说了。&lt;br&gt;我学的不是民科经济学。&lt;br&gt;而是正儿八经的主流经济学。&lt;br&gt;我说的不买期房是博弈论里的东西，发现金和发实物差异牵涉到替代效应收入效应的应用，外贸问题根源是国际贸易经济学CA TB的差异，雪糕问题是产业经济学的价格歧视，还有行为经济学的定价………</p>","excerpt":"后台都问我为什么回答金融、经济以及其他…","voteupCount":153,"commentCount":10,"created":1657126364,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1528179414847873024"},{"id":"1527631707171315712","title":"[想法的图片]","content":"<img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-e089e4b779ae106984a18624fde27dbf_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1196\" height=\"348\">","excerpt":"[想法的图片]","voteupCount":130,"commentCount":34,"created":1656995781,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1527631707171315712"}]}